; One variable: `layout_direction = 3` on a Label. `Label::_get_line_rect` swaps its
; HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT and _RIGHT arms under RTL (label.cpp:481-497) and leaves _CENTER, so
; each RTL row sits at the opposite edge from its LTR twin and the centred pair stays. Full-width
; Labels make the rect mirror (control.cpp:1785) the identity. No other fixture pairs the two.

